@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：聊天協商、預約與站內轉帳

actor 買家 as Buyer
actor 賣家 as Seller
participant "ChatRoomScreen" as UI
participant "ApiService(ChatApi)" as ApiSvc
participant "POST /rooms/:id/messages" as MsgRoute
participant "messages.js" as MsgSvc
participant "POST /rooms/:id/reservations" as ResRoute
participant "reservations.js" as ResSvc
participant "verification中介層" as Verify
participant "POST /rooms/:id/transfers" as TxRoute
participant "chat/transfers.js" as TransferSvc
participant "wallet.js" as WalletSvc
database "Prisma / MariaDB" as DB

Buyer -> UI : 傳送文字/圖片議價訊息
UI -> ApiSvc : sendChatMessage(roomId, content)
ApiSvc -> MsgRoute : POST /rooms/:roomId/messages
MsgRoute -> MsgSvc : send(roomId, sender, content, type)
MsgSvc -> DB : chat_messages.create()
MsgSvc -> DB : notify 對方（新訊息）

Buyer -> UI : 請求「保留此書」
UI -> ApiSvc : requestReservation(roomId, bookId, hours)
ApiSvc -> ResRoute : POST /rooms/:roomId/reservations
ResRoute -> ResSvc : request(roomId, buyer, book, hours)
ResSvc -> DB : reservations.create(status='pending')
ResSvc -> DB : notify 賣家

Seller -> UI : 於聊天室點擊「同意保留」
UI -> ApiSvc : respondReservation(reservationId, 'accept')
ApiSvc -> ResSvc : respond(reservationId, 'accept')
ResSvc -> ResSvc : 再次檢查書況/是否被他人持有
ResSvc -> DB : reservations.update(status='confirmed')
ResSvc -> DB : 取消該書其他pending預約
ResSvc -> DB : notify 買家

== 站內轉帳（議價後付款） ==
Buyer -> UI : 開啟轉帳，輸入金額
UI -> ApiSvc : fetchWallet()（檢查餘額）
alt 餘額不足
  UI -> UI : 顯示「前往錢包加值」
else 餘額足夠
  UI -> Buyer : 要求輸入交易密碼/生物辨識
  UI -> ApiSvc : sendCoinTransfer(roomId, toUserId, amount)
  ApiSvc -> Verify : requireVerification('payment')
  Verify --> TxRoute : 驗證通過
  ApiSvc -> TxRoute : POST /rooms/:roomId/transfers
  TxRoute -> TransferSvc : send(roomId, from, to, amount)
  TransferSvc -> TransferSvc : reachableUser() / assertCanMessage()
  TransferSvc -> WalletSvc : moveFunds(tx, from, to, amount)\n(依user_id排序避免死結)
  WalletSvc -> DB : changeBalance(from, -amount, 'transfer_out')
  WalletSvc -> DB : changeBalance(to, +amount, 'transfer_in')
  TransferSvc -> DB : chat_transfers.insert(status='completed')
  TransferSvc -> DB : 貼出系統訊息卡片 + notify 收款人
  TransferSvc --> UI : 200 OK
end
@enduml
